 "narrative": "## The trajectory\nRevenue was $104.8B in FY2025 [1].\nRevenue CAGR was +4.5% over FY2016..FY2025 [2].\nNet income was $3.7B in FY2025 [3].\n\n## Growth quality\nRevenue growth in FY2025 was -1.7% [1] [4].\nNet income growth in FY2025 was -9.4% [3] [5].\nIn FY2025, net income growth of -9.4% [3] [5] was below revenue growth of -1.7% [1] [4].\n\n## Margins\nGross margin was 28.5% in FY2017 [6].\nOperating margin was 4.9% in FY2025 [7].\nNet margin was 3.5% in FY2025 [8].\nOperating margin changed -0.3pp in FY2025 [7] [9].\n\n## Cash & balance sheet\nIn FY2025, free cash flow of $2.8B [10] was below net income of $3.7B [3].\nThe current ratio was 0.94\u00d7 in FY2025 [11], below 1.00\u00d7.\nIn FY2025, operating cash flow of $6.6B [12] was above net income of $3.7B [3].\n\n## Red flags\nCurrent ratio is below 1.0 (0.94\u00d7 in FY2025). Source operands: Current ratio 0.9436x in FY2016 [13]; Current ratio 0.9423x in FY2025 [11].\n\n## What to watch next\nWatch whether revenue growth in the next reporting update improves from -1.7% in FY2025 [1] [4].\nWatch how net income in the next reporting update compares with $3.7B in FY2025 [3].\nWatch how operating margin in the next reporting update compares with 4.9% in FY2025 [7].",
